{
  "an4.191:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.191 ",
  "an4.191:0.2": "20. The Great Chapter ",
  "an4.191:0.3": "Followed by Ear ",
  "an4.191:1.1": "“Mendicants, you can expect four benefits when the teachings have been followed by ear, consolidated by voice, examined by the mind, and well penetrated theoretically. ",
  "an4.191:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.191:1.3": "Take a mendicant who memorizes the teaching—",
  "an4.191:1.4": "statements, mixed prose & verse, discussions, verses, inspired exclamations, legends, stories of past lives, amazing stories, and elaborations. ",
  "an4.191:1.5": "They’ve followed those teachings by ear, consolidated them by voice, examined them by the mind, and well penetrated them theoretically. ",
  "an4.191:1.6": "But they die unmindful and are reborn in one of the orders of gods. ",
  "an4.191:1.7": "Being happy there, passages of the teaching come back to them. ",
  "an4.191:1.8": "Memory comes up slowly, ",
  "an4.191:1.9": "but then that being quickly reaches distinction. ",
  "an4.191:1.10": "This is the first benefit you can expect when the teachings have been followed by ear, consolidated by voice, examined by the mind, and well penetrated theoretically. ",
  "an4.191:2.1": "Furthermore, take a mendicant who memorizes the teaching—",
  "an4.191:2.2": "statements, mixed prose & verse, discussions, verses, inspired exclamations, legends, stories of past lives, amazing stories, and elaborations. ",
  "an4.191:2.3": "They’ve followed those teachings by ear, consolidat